T2  - FAIK: A Practical Guide to Living in a World of Deepfakes, Disinformation, and AI-Generated Deceptions
AB  - Summary <p>AI can be used for some pretty sketchy stuff. It is helping doctors spot diseases early, making education more accessible, pitching in to help some of humanity's biggest problems, and&#x2014;yes&#x2014;even showing promise as a critical aid in the fight against online deception. What is truly eye&#x2010;opening is how AI amplifies the age&#x2010;old tactics, creating a landscape where discerning truth from fiction becomes increasingly challenging. While AI can be a formidable tool for deception, it is ultimately human intent that determines its impact. The digital deception game is only going to get more intense. Practicing extreme empathy is not just about being nice&#x2014;it should be central in our fight against digital deception. It helps us connect, communicate, and ultimately, it makes our efforts to spread digital literacy far more trustworthy and effective.</p>
