AB  - The exponential growth of video content on platforms like YouTube has intensified the need for personalized, secure, and dynamic content delivery. This paper proposes an innovative AI-driven frame- work that synthesizes personalized videos in real time based on YouTube search queries and complements them with contextually relevant recommen- dations. By integrating advanced Natural Language Processing (NLP), generative Video Diffusion Models (VDMs), computer vision, and built- in cybersecurity mechanisms, the system delivers high-quality, user- centric, and trustworthy videos tailored to individual intents. Un- like existing synthesis systems that primarily focus on visual fidelity without contextual adaptation, and YouTube's current recommendation engine that only suggests pre-existing content without generating new video material, the proposed framework dynamically creates and recommends secure, intent-specific videos. Exten-sive experiments demonstrate a 25 percent improvement in relevance over existing YouTube recom- men- dations for niche queries, with an average query- to-video latency of 5.2 seconds.
